    WILL CURSE YOU IF YOU EVER ENTER THEM, EVEN IN A CALCULATOR. TEN YEARS OF STINKY
    ELBOWS GUARANTEED.\""
  TextForRepetition: 'We already did that, remember?

    And we shouldn''t push
    it any further.



